    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. I like the grit. To really nail that \"primitive\" vibe, I want to lean into their biological or inherent nature. Does it feel like their lack of civilization is more about their environment, or is there something in their actual lineage or race that makes them naturally more inclined towards this kind of chaos and violence compared to the more 'evolved' protagonists? Like, is it an inherent trait?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
